* Screw Jack Assembly *

This project involves the 3D modeling and assembly design of a Screw Jack using SolidWorks. 
The assembly consists of seven individual components: Body, Cup, Screw Spindle, Nut, Washer, CSK Screw, and Tommy Bar. 
Each component was designed with appropriate dimensions and assembled to demonstrate the working arrangement and mechanical structure of the screw jack.
The project also includes detailed engineering drawings of individual components and the complete assembly, featuring orthographic views, sectional views, an isometric view, and dimensional specifications.
This project helped develop practical skills in 3D part modeling, assembly design, component integration, and engineering drawing preparation.


Project Details
Software Used: SolidWorks
Project Type: 3D Part Modeling and Assembly
Components: 7 individual parts
Additional Content: 2D Drafting and Engineering Drawing Sheets
